"报告不包含事件名称、事件日期、事件标识、账号、凭据或完整用户路径。导出只是将 JSON 文件保存到你选择的位置，不会自动发送。你可以检查文件后自行分享。" = "The report excludes event names, dates and IDs, accounts, credentials and full user paths. Export only saves a JSON file to your chosen location; it is never sent automatically. Review the file before sharing it yourself.";
"报告只包含应用和系统版本、存储方式、事件数量、读取结果的一般错误类别、通知权限、小组件扩展状态，以及减少动态效果、增强对比度、降低透明度设置。" = "The report contains only app and system versions, storage mode, event counts, general read-error categories, notification permission, widget extension status, and the Reduce Motion, Increase Contrast and Reduce Transparency settings.";
