"固定中号事件" = "Fixed Medium Events";
"编辑中号小组件，开启“中号手动选择事件”，按第一、第二、第三槽位选择最多三个事件。重复选择只显示一次；归档或删除后该槽位显示不可用，不会替换为其他事件。小号仍使用原来的事件选择。" = "Edit a medium widget, enable manual selection, and choose up to three events in slot order. Duplicate choices appear once. Archived or deleted events show an unavailable slot instead of another event. Small widgets keep their original selection.";
"快捷指令" = "Shortcuts";
