"编辑事件，展开“重复提醒”，分别设置每日、每满一个月和每满一年的时间。每日显示通知当天的天数；满月与周年按原始日期计算，短月用月末，闰年恢复原日。系统队列容量有限，可在设置查看已安排日期；开启并获系统批准的后台刷新会在退出后定时补排。" = "Edit an event and expand Repeat reminders to set separate times for daily, monthly and yearly reminders. Daily messages show the day count on the delivery date. Milestones use the original date, clamping short months to month-end and restoring leap days. The system queue is limited; Settings shows scheduled dates. Background refresh replenishes the queue after quitting when enabled and approved by macOS.";

