"标签与颜色" = "Tags and Colors";

"编辑事件时填写标签，使用逗号分隔；搜索可匹配名称或标签。在“更多选项 → 颜色”点击“自定颜色…”打开系统色轮，也可用预设。保存才生效，取消保留原数据。" = "Separate event tags with commas and search by name or tag. Under More Options → Color, choose Custom Color… to open the system color wheel or pick a preset. Changes apply only when saved; Cancel keeps the original data.";

"自动筛选与大号组件" = "Filters and Large Widgets";

"每个组件独立设置范围、包含全部或任一标签、排除标签、排序、优先置顶和跳过前几条。先筛选、排序、跳过，再展示。中号最多三条，大号每页五至十条；更多事件用页码旁的按钮翻页，不支持滚动或滑动。中号手动槽位不受自动筛选影响。" = "Each widget independently sets its scope, all/any included tags, excluded tags, sort, pinned priority, and skip count. Filtering, sorting, and skipping happen before display. Medium shows up to three events; large shows five to ten per page, with page buttons for additional events. Scrolling and swiping are not supported. Manual medium slots ignore automatic filters.";

